      {"t":"thread_messages","rows":[{"thread_id":"@thread:member","from_role":false,"body":"Hello, I have been coming to the weekly gathering for two months. How do I apply for a yearly membership, and who can vouch for me?","created_at":"-2d@11:00"},{"thread_id":"@thread:rsvp","from_role":false,"body":"My brother is visiting from out of town. Can he come to the festival night with us, and do I change our RSVP in the app?","created_at":"-1d@19:30"},{"thread_id":"@thread:school","from_role":false,"body":"Anaya asked whether class meets the weekend after the festival or whether there is a break.","created_at":"-1d@08:15"},{"thread_id":"@thread:carpool","from_role":false,"body":"I do not drive on the highway. Is there a carpool from the north zone on the morning of the appreciation dinner?","created_at":"-1d@15:00"},{"thread_id":"@thread:gathering","from_role":false,"body":"Nobody has written yet about this month's gathering. Can the zone lead confirm the host and the day?","created_at":"-3d@10:20"},{"thread_id":"@thread:summary","from_role":false,"body":"We would like a summary of our family's gifts this year for our records. Is it in the app, and when is it ready?","created_at":"-4d@09:40"},{"thread_id":"@thread:summary","author_user":"@actor","from_role":true,"body":"Thank you for asking. Your gifts and receipts are under Give in the app, and the year-end summary is added there in January. If you need one sooner, write to us and we will prepare it. (Demo reply.)","created_at":"-3d@10:15"}]},
