      {"t":"content_items","rows":[{"id":"@content:x.join","kind":"faq","slug":"how-to-join-demo","title":"How do I join? (demo)","body_md":"Apply for a yearly membership in the app. A member who knows you vouches for you, then the membership team decides. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"published","published_at":"-40d@10:00","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-40d@10:00"},{"id":"@content:x.gathering","kind":"explainer","slug":"weekly-gathering-demo","title":"What happens at a weekly gathering (demo)","body_md":"A short service, a talk and a shared lunch. Everyone is welcome; sit where you are comfortable. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"published","published_at":"-30d@10:00","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-30d@10:00"},{"id":"@content:x.visit","kind":"niva_source","slug":"niva-visiting-us-demo","title":"Visiting us","body_md":"Everyone is welcome. Silence your phone and sit where you are comfortable. Arrive a few minutes early, dress modestly and say hello at the office. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"approved","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-20d@10:00"},{"id":"@content:x.parking","kind":"niva_source","slug":"niva-parking-demo","title":"Parking and access","body_md":"The east door is step-free. Overflow parking opens on busy days; volunteers will guide you. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"approved","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-20d@10:00"},{"id":"@content:x.times","kind":"niva_source","slug":"niva-times-demo","title":"Times and visiting","body_md":"Weekly gathering on Sundays 10:00 AM to 1:00 PM, shared lunch at noon, Learning Center classes 10:00 to 11:30 AM, store pickup 11:00 AM to 1:00 PM, front office open weekdays 9:00 AM to 4:00 PM. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"approved","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-20d@10:00"},{"id":"@content:x.membership","kind":"niva_source","slug":"niva-membership-demo","title":"Membership","body_md":"A yearly membership includes your spouse and lets you vote at the annual meeting. A life membership also needs the executive committee's approval. (Demo.)","language":"en","metadata":{},"status":"approved","approved_by":"@actor","created_by":"@actor","created_at":"-20d@10:00"}]},
